- src/WorkerSpecifier.sol
  Copy of impl/specifier/src/WorkerSpecifier.sol, byte for byte
  (sha256 f86a1da4e84433a731bf6f96b0a0b7f196fc946c5753914d1e0471c0033ce5be).
  Kept unmodified so that it compiles to the same runtime code as the
  WorkerSpecifier deployments on Ethereum mainnet (test/ReferenceBytecode.t.sol).

- test/WorkerSpecifier.t.sol
  Copy of impl/specifier/test/WorkerSpecifier.t.sol, byte for byte
  (sha256 e924eb24d971335f4392e597ed37eacbb99967927a13084a9a2400aa51707ba2).

- src/IWorkerSpecifier.sol
  The IWorkerSpecifier interface from SPEC.md §4 (anon-rpc specification
  version 0.3.2), with the same declarations and comments, re-indented by
  forge fmt.

The tests also execute src/host/specifier.ts and src/host/kps-http.ts of the npm
package @anon-rpc/browser-harness 0.3.2 (MIT, Ethereum Foundation), installed as
a development dependency and not redistributed here.

